# Known-bad dependency versions excluded from CI resolution.
#
# These pins apply ONLY to CI (via ci-constraints.txt); package metadata in
# pyproject.toml stays open so users are never restricted by them.
#
# Each entry must carry a reason and a removal condition.

# qutip 5.3.1 switched Data.as_scipy() to SciPy's sparse-array API
# (csr_array/csc_array). scqubits <= 4.3.1 only dispatches on the legacy
# spmatrix types and raises TypeError in convert_operator_to_qobj.
# Remove once a scqubits release supports sparse arrays.
qutip<5.3.1
